<div class="p-4">
    <div class="row g-3 mb-4">
        <div class="col-md-3">
            <div class="card stat-card"><div class="card-body">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <div><h6 class="card-subtitle mb-1 text-muted">EK 记录</h6><h2 class="card-title mb-0" id="ekCount">-</h2></div>
                    <i class="bi bi-cpu display-6 text-muted"></i>
                </div>
            </div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
            <div class="card stat-card"><div class="card-body">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <div><h6 class="card-subtitle mb-1 text-muted">AK 记录</h6><h2 class="card-title mb-0" id="akCount">-</h2></div>
                    <i class="bi bi-key display-6 text-muted"></i>
                </div>
            </div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
            <div class="card stat-card"><div class="card-body">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <div><h6 class="card-subtitle mb-1 text-muted">验证记录</h6><h2 class="card-title mb-0" id="historyCount">-</h2></div>
                    <i class="bi bi-journal-text display-6 text-muted"></i>
                </div>
            </div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-3">
            <div class="card stat-card"><div class="card-body">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <div><h6 class="card-subtitle mb-1 text-muted">上次验证</h6><h6 class="card-title mb-0" id="lastResult" style="font-size:1rem">-</h6></div>
                    <i class="bi bi-clipboard-check display-6 text-muted"></i>
                </div>
            </div></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="nav nav-tabs mb-3" role="tablist">
        <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link active" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabHistory"><i class="bi bi-clock-history me-1"></i>验证历史</button></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabKeys"><i class="bi bi-key me-1"></i>EK / AK 列表</button></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabVbs"><i class="bi bi-cpu-fill me-1"></i>运行时检测</button></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tabConfig"><i class="bi bi-gear me-1"></i>系统配置</button></li>
    </ul>

    <div class="tab-content">
        <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="tabHistory">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-clock-history me-2"></i>验证历史记录</span>
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <div class="input-group input-group-sm" style="width:260px">
                            <input type="text" class="form-control" id="tpmHistorySearch" placeholder="搜索 ID / 时间 / EK / 结果..." onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter')filterTpmHistory()">
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary" onclick="filterTpmHistory()"><i class="bi bi-search"></i></button>
                        </div>
                        <button class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-sm" onclick="loadHistory()"><i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise"></i> 刷新</button>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body p-0">
                    <div class="table-responsive">
                        <table class="table table-hover mb-0">
                            <thead><tr><th>时间</th><th>ID</th><th>EK 指纹</th><th>签名</th><th>Magic</th><th>Nonce</th><th>PCR</th><th>结果</th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="historyTable"><tr><td colspan="8" class="text-center text-muted py-4">加载中...</td></tr></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tabKeys">
            <div class="row g-3">
                <div class="col-md-6"><div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-cpu me-2"></i>Endorsement Keys (EK)</div>
                    <div class="card-body p-0"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-hover mb-0">
                        <thead><tr><th>指纹</th><th>Subject</th><th>注册时间</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody id="ekTable"><tr><td colspan="3" class="text-center text-muted py-3">加载中...</td></tr></tbody>
                    </table></div></div>
                </div></div>
                <div class="col-md-6"><div class="card">
                    <div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-key me-2"></i>Attestation Keys (AK)</div>
                    <div class="card-body p-0"><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-hover mb-0">
                        <thead><tr><th>AK Name</th><th>EK 指纹</th><th>注册时间</th></tr></thead>
                        <tbody id="akTable"><tr><td colspan="3" class="text-center text-muted py-3">加载中...</td></tr></tbody>
                    </table></div></div>
                </div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tabVbs">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-cpu-fill me-2"></i>VBS / HVCI 运行态检测</span>
                    <button class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-sm" onclick="loadVbsHistory()"><i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise"></i> 刷新</button>
                </div>
                <div class="card-body p-0">
                    <div class="table-responsive">
                        <table class="table table-hover mb-0">
                            <thead><tr><th>时间</th><th>ID</th><th>客户端 IP</th><th title="方案A: VBS Root Claim 链验证">方案A</th><th title="方案D: PoP 签名验证">方案D</th><th title="方案C: 运行时报告验证 (可选)">方案C</th><th>Nonce</th><th>驱动数</th><th>判定</th><th></th></tr></thead>
                            <tbody id="vbsHistoryTable"><tr><td colspan="10" class="text-center text-muted py-4">加载中...</td></tr></tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer text-muted small">
                    <i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i>
                    <span class="fw-bold">判定依据 (全部服务器侧验证):</span><br/>
                    <span class="fw-bold">方案A — VBS Root Claim 链验证:</span>
                    客户端以 NCRYPT_REQUIRE_VBS_FLAG 创建 VTL1 隔离密钥 (仅 Secure Kernel 运行时才能成功),
                    由 VTL1 内的 IDKS (VBS 根签名密钥) 签发 VBS Root Claim (nonce 绑定服务器 challenge),
                    服务器导入客户端公钥后调用 NCryptVerifyClaim 远程验证签名链, 并校验公钥模数与 claim Attributes 内 SPKI 一致 → 证明 VBS 正在运行。<br/>
                    <span class="fw-bold">方案B — PoP 签名验证:</span>
                    客户端用同一把 VTL1 密钥对 canonical(会话ID, nonce, claim 摘要) 做 PKCS1/SHA256 签名,
                    服务器从 claim Attributes 提取 SPKI 公钥 (被 Secure Kernel 报告哈希绑定) 验签 → 证明客户端持有该 VTL1 密钥, 防重放防转投。<br/>
                    <span class="fw-bold">方案C — 运行时报告验证:</span>
                    客户端调用 GetRuntimeAttestationReport 获取 Secure Kernel 签名的
                    Driver 运行时报告, 服务器校验 nonce 绑定 + SHA-512 digest 一致, 并解析全部已加载驱动清单以证明 HVCI 正在运行。
                    客户端无该 API 导出时可跳过，因为这个API是在最近才加入Windows的。
                    <span class="fw-bold">SK 签名信任链:</span> 报告的签名者 IDKS 被度量进 PCR12 (VSMIDKSInfo 事件, 0x00050023),
                    客户端提交该公钥后, 服务器用其验证报告的 SHA512-RSA-PSS 签名 — IDKS 的可信性由 TPM Quote 覆盖 PCR12 的度量重放保证, 篡改报告或替换 IDKS 均无法通过。
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tabConfig">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header"><i class="bi bi-gear me-2"></i>服务器配置</div>
                <div class="card-body"><div class="row" id="configInfo"><div class="col-12 text-center text-muted py-4">加载中...</div></div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="modal fade" id="detailModal" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-scrollable">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header"><h5 class="modal-title">验证详情</h5><button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal"></button></div>
            <div class="modal-body" id="detailBody"></div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<script src="/js/tpm-dashboard.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
